{"4989280":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Light Source","steam_appid":4989280,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5025150,5123820],"detailed_description":"<h1>Official Steam Page<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/d6a2b9c1149a574733265860a108efa8.avif?t=1793694353\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras_big\/d6a2b9c1149a574733265860a108efa8.webp?t=1793694353 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light source officially has a Steam page now! Rejoice in the light oh Bulbs! The game will release on the 3rd of November but before that there will be a playable Demo ready for players to dive into and learn a bit more about Lumeria! <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay tuned, more to come soon!<\/p><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/570ca299cfcbf3a83cf17e5568fd49e4.avif?t=1793694353\" width=816 height=122 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Uncover the secrets of Lumeria<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/1e10e56cc101c8268c4afc2c34e45250.poster.avif?t=1793694353\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/1e10e56cc101c8268c4afc2c34e45250.webm?t=1793694353\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/1e10e56cc101c8268c4afc2c34e45250.mp4?t=1793694353\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom of Lumeria is in it's twilight years. Light hasn't touched the land in ages and no one knows what must be done to restore it. Whispers travel through the kingdom about a source of infinite light. A power so great that it could be the very answer to the kingdoms problem. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/26ecea7b39f164948e0885526fde19a3.avif?t=1793694353\" width=816 height=187 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Make new friends or enemies<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/9ef3fce7b4c5a76b69d4bb5e22735a32.poster.avif?t=1793694353\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/9ef3fce7b4c5a76b69d4bb5e22735a32.webm?t=1793694353\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/9ef3fce7b4c5a76b69d4bb5e22735a32.mp4?t=1793694353\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through the abandoned corridors of Lumeria and face the nightmares that haunt the citizens of this once great kingdom. Forge alliances and choose whether to help the lamps you find on your journey. Unlock the secrets of this world and make meaningful choices that will affect the lives of those you meet as well as yours. The fate of the kingdom is in your hands, will you ascend to become its saviour?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/dfb7f708dacf6443330a35b8ec3a2c1c.avif?t=1793694353\" width=816 height=147 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Character Customization<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/7016d1d352bf80d7dcfff5896285af05.poster.avif?t=1793694353\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/7016d1d352bf80d7dcfff5896285af05.webm?t=1793694353\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/7016d1d352bf80d7dcfff5896285af05.mp4?t=1793694353\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your character through meaningful stat progression by choosing which specific stat you want strengthened and utilize weapons that compliment the playstyle you have chosen. Break the game, there is no cap to how strong you can become, push the game to it's limits. Equip trinkets found around Lumeria and cast devastating spells and abilities to gain an advantage over your foes. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/22627510d8c957e266fb8be337f954ea.avif?t=1793694353\" width=816 height=122 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strategic yet relaxed gameplay<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/98145542964a0922c87e6823fc4fa7a1.poster.avif?t=1793694353\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/98145542964a0922c87e6823fc4fa7a1.webm?t=1793694353\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/98145542964a0922c87e6823fc4fa7a1.mp4?t=1793694353\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed gameplay: The classic turn-based combat allows you to pick up and put down the game whenever you feel like it. No pausing required. Carefully choose when to attack, defend or use an item in order to survive the onslaught of enemies. Prepare your items and rush headfirst into the action.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/193357c9f53b6cfbb9aed5e76cc857d2.avif?t=1793694353\" width=912 height=579 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/570ca299cfcbf3a83cf17e5568fd49e4.avif?t=1793694353\" width=816 height=122 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Uncover the secrets of Lumeria<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/1e10e56cc101c8268c4afc2c34e45250.poster.avif?t=1793694353\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/1e10e56cc101c8268c4afc2c34e45250.webm?t=1793694353\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/1e10e56cc101c8268c4afc2c34e45250.mp4?t=1793694353\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom of Lumeria is in it's twilight years. Light hasn't touched the land in ages and no one knows what must be done to restore it. Whispers travel through the kingdom about a source of infinite light. A power so great that it could be the very answer to the kingdoms problem. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/26ecea7b39f164948e0885526fde19a3.avif?t=1793694353\" width=816 height=187 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Make new friends or enemies<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/9ef3fce7b4c5a76b69d4bb5e22735a32.poster.avif?t=1793694353\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/9ef3fce7b4c5a76b69d4bb5e22735a32.webm?t=1793694353\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/9ef3fce7b4c5a76b69d4bb5e22735a32.mp4?t=1793694353\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through the abandoned corridors of Lumeria and face the nightmares that haunt the citizens of this once great kingdom. Forge alliances and choose whether to help the lamps you find on your journey. Unlock the secrets of this world and make meaningful choices that will affect the lives of those you meet as well as yours. The fate of the kingdom is in your hands, will you ascend to become its saviour?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/dfb7f708dacf6443330a35b8ec3a2c1c.avif?t=1793694353\" width=816 height=147 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Character Customization<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/7016d1d352bf80d7dcfff5896285af05.poster.avif?t=1793694353\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/7016d1d352bf80d7dcfff5896285af05.webm?t=1793694353\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/7016d1d352bf80d7dcfff5896285af05.mp4?t=1793694353\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your character through meaningful stat progression by choosing which specific stat you want strengthened and utilize weapons that compliment the playstyle you have chosen. Break the game, there is no cap to how strong you can become, push the game to it's limits. Equip trinkets found around Lumeria and cast devastating spells and abilities to gain an advantage over your foes. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/22627510d8c957e266fb8be337f954ea.avif?t=1793694353\" width=816 height=122 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strategic yet relaxed gameplay<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/98145542964a0922c87e6823fc4fa7a1.poster.avif?t=1793694353\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/98145542964a0922c87e6823fc4fa7a1.webm?t=1793694353\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/98145542964a0922c87e6823fc4fa7a1.mp4?t=1793694353\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed gameplay: The classic turn-based combat allows you to pick up and put down the game whenever you feel like it. No pausing required. Carefully choose when to attack, defend or use an item in order to survive the onslaught of enemies. Prepare your items and rush headfirst into the action.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/extras\/193357c9f53b6cfbb9aed5e76cc857d2.avif?t=1793694353\" width=912 height=579 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Follow Bulb and bring back the light to the dim kingdom of Lumeria, in this dark 2D turn-based RPG. Help the locals and battle your way through increasingly harder odds while uncovering the secrets hidden within the decaying kingdom.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/b5b1e98066cca3185388ce7d1f4d2cfdbaf11118\/header.jpg?t=1793694353","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/bcb18f99d0d6f9afaf7c3c4bccf1dede74336341\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793694353","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4989280\/bcb18f99d0d6f9afaf7c3c4bccf1dede74336341\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793694353","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Microsoft® Windows® 7\/8\/8.1\/10\/11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core2 Duo or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 9\/OpenGL 4.1 capable GPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Microsoft® Windows® 7\/8\/8.1\/10\/11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core2 Duo or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 9\/OpenGL 4.1 capable GPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Mac OSX 10.10 or better. Not supported: macOS Big Sur 11.0 and later.<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core2 Duo or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Compatible OpenGLR<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Left Marino"],"publishers":["Left Marino"],"demos":[{"appid":5025150,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":699,"final":629,"discount_percent":10,"initial_formatted":"$6.99","final_formatted":"$6.29"},"packages":[1730882],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Light Source","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1730882,"percent_savings_text":"-10% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Light Source - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$6.99<\/span> $6.29","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":629}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":28,